 =item B<-oa> B<sparse>
 
 =item B<-oa> B<preallocated>
@@ -594,117 +548,11 @@ For I<-o openstack> (L<virt-v2v-output-openstack(1)>) only, set optional
 OpenStack authentication.  For example I<-oo os-username=>NAME is
 equivalent to C<openstack --os-username=NAME>.
 
-=item B<-oo ovirt-cafile=>F<ca.pem>
-
-For I<-o ovirt-upload> (L<virt-v2v-output-ovirt(1)>) only, the
-F<ca.pem> file (Certificate Authority), copied from
